  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenskt bist&#xe5;nd till Kroatien fasas ut. St&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;llet slutade 2006. F&#xf6;r att samla in erfarenheter fr&#xe5;n detta st&#xf6;d anordnar Sida ett seminarium i maj 2007 med de organisationer som f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d. En konsult anlitas f&#xf6;r att dokumentera erfarenheterna</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has supported Croatia and the Civil Society there during 15 years. The experienced from this support to CS will be summed up and discussed during a seminar in May with the NGOs which have received support. A consultant will document the outcome of the discussions.</narrative>
  </description>
